(UUID(),'primary','About PCMO','about','About','Learn about PCMO, its professional community, and its commitment to project and contract management excellence.','PCMO brings together project and contract management professionals through learning, certification, membership, knowledge sharing, and professional networking. Use the admin Content section to expand this page with the organisation’s mission, vision, governance, and history.','published',10),
(UUID(),'primary','Membership & Networking','membership_and_networking','Membership','Build professional connections, access member resources, and participate in the PCMO community.','PCMO membership supports continuous professional development, peer networking, knowledge exchange, and access to member opportunities.','published',20),
